    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "p0", "x": 80, "y": 130, "width": 250, "height": 1230, "strokeColor": "#c2410c", "backgroundColor": "#fed7aa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 700030, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700031, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "p0t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "p0t", "x": 90, "y": 145, "width": 230, "height": 1200, "text": "Phase 0\nSW Validation\n\n기간: 1주 sprint\n\nHW: CM4 + eMMC\n     Waveshare carrier\n\nDeliverables:\n• 40 파일 / 3,545 라인\n• Go agent + cgo HAL\n• 6-in-1 Sensor Profile\n• systemd unit\n• smoke_test.sh (7건)\n• 24hr burn-in\n\n진입조건: -\n탈출조건:\n• smoke 7/7 PASS\n• burn-in: RSS<5%\n• error log = 0\n\n현재 위치 ✅", "originalText": "Phase 0\nSW Validation\n\n기간: 1주 sprint\n\nHW: CM4 + eMMC\n     Waveshare carrier\n\nDeliverables:\n• 40 파일 / 3,545 라인\n• Go agent + cgo HAL\n• 6-in-1 Sensor Profile\n• systemd unit\n• smoke_test.sh (7건)\n• 24hr burn-in\n\n진입조건: -\n탈출조건:\n• smoke 7/7 PASS\n• burn-in: RSS<5%\n• error log = 0\n\n현재 위치 ✅", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 700032, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700033, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "p0", "lineHeight": 1.4},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "p1", "x": 380, "y": 130, "width": 250, "height": 1230, "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#93c5fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 700040, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700041, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "p1t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "p1t", "x": 390, "y": 145, "width": 230, "height": 1200, "text": "Phase 1\nServer 인프라\n\n기간: 1주\n\nHW: 사내 물리 서버\n     Ubuntu 24.04 LTS\n\nDeliverables:\n• PostgreSQL 16\n• VerneMQ\n• Keycloak realm\n• Nginx + certbot\n• systemd 5종\n• /etc/iot-platform/\n• 운영 절차서\n• phase1_smoke.sh\n\n진입조건:\n• Phase 0 통과\n탈출조건:\n• 5 service active\n• Keycloak login OK\n• mosquitto auth OK\n• 코드 0줄 (인프라만)", "originalText": "Phase 1\nServer 인프라\n\n기간: 1주\n\nHW: 사내 물리 서버\n     Ubuntu 24.04 LTS\n\nDeliverables:\n• PostgreSQL 16\n• VerneMQ\n• Keycloak realm\n• Nginx + certbot\n• systemd 5종\n• /etc/iot-platform/\n• 운영 절차서\n• phase1_smoke.sh\n\n진입조건:\n• Phase 0 통과\n탈출조건:\n• 5 service active\n• Keycloak login OK\n• mosquitto auth OK\n• 코드 0줄 (인프라만)", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 700042, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700043, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "p1", "lineHeight": 1.4},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "p2", "x": 680, "y": 130, "width": 250, "height": 1230, "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#60a5fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 700050, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700051, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "p2t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "p2t", "x": 690, "y": 145, "width": 230, "height": 1200, "text": "Phase 2\n다중 Gateway\n권한 모델\n\n기간: TBD\n\nDeliverables:\n• companies\n• sites\n• users\n• gateways\n• user_*_permissions\n• Backend skeleton\n• Login 화면\n\n진입조건:\n• Phase 1 통과\n• 첫 customer 인터뷰\n  완료 (assignment)\n탈출조건:\n• 사용자별 Gateway\n  필터링 OK\n• Keycloak ↔ Backend\n  권한 매핑 OK", "originalText": "Phase 2\n다중 Gateway\n권한 모델\n\n기간: TBD\n\nDeliverables:\n• companies\n• sites\n• users\n• gateways\n• user_*_permissions\n• Backend skeleton\n• Login 화면\n\n진입조건:\n• Phase 1 통과\n• 첫 customer 인터뷰\n  완료 (assignment)\n탈출조건:\n• 사용자별 Gateway\n  필터링 OK\n• Keycloak ↔ Backend\n  권한 매핑 OK", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 700052, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700053, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "p2", "lineHeight": 1.4},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "p3", "x": 980, "y": 130, "width": 250, "height": 1230, "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#60a5fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 700060, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700061, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "p3t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "p3t", "x": 990, "y": 145, "width": 230, "height": 1200, "text": "Phase 3\nSensor Profile\nChannel + Telemetry\n\n기간: TBD\n\nDeliverables:\n• sensor_profiles\n• sensor_channels\n• telemetry partition\n• telemetry_latest\n• Sensor Wizard 8단계\n• Dynamic Dashboard\n• ECharts 시계열\n\n진입조건:\n• Phase 2 통과\n• 6-in-1 센서 입수\n탈출조건:\n• 6 measurement 모두\n  대시보드 표시\n• 새 sensor 추가 시\n  코드 수정 0", "originalText": "Phase 3\nSensor Profile\nChannel + Telemetry\n\n기간: TBD\n\nDeliverables:\n• sensor_profiles\n• sensor_channels\n• telemetry partition\n• telemetry_latest\n• Sensor Wizard 8단계\n• Dynamic Dashboard\n• ECharts 시계열\n\n진입조건:\n• Phase 2 통과\n• 6-in-1 센서 입수\n탈출조건:\n• 6 measurement 모두\n  대시보드 표시\n• 새 sensor 추가 시\n  코드 수정 0", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 700062, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700063, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "p3", "lineHeight": 1.4},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "p4", "x": 1280, "y": 130, "width": 250, "height": 1230, "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#60a5fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 700070, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700071, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "p4t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "p4t", "x": 1290, "y": 145, "width": 230, "height": 1200, "text": "Phase 4\nActuator + 원격제어\n\n기간: TBD\n\nDeliverables:\n• actuator_profiles\n• actuator_channels\n• command flow 11단계\n• safety check 8가지\n• audit_log\n• 제어 권한 분리\n• 알람 rule + auto\n  control\n\n진입조건:\n• Phase 3 통과\n• 릴레이/밸브 입수\n탈출조건:\n• 환기팬 ON/OFF OK\n• max_on_duration\n  강제 OFF OK\n• 만료 명령 거부 OK", "originalText": "Phase 4\nActuator + 원격제어\n\n기간: TBD\n\nDeliverables:\n• actuator_profiles\n• actuator_channels\n• command flow 11단계\n• safety check 8가지\n• audit_log\n• 제어 권한 분리\n• 알람 rule + auto\n  control\n\n진입조건:\n• Phase 3 통과\n• 릴레이/밸브 입수\n탈출조건:\n• 환기팬 ON/OFF OK\n• max_on_duration\n  강제 OFF OK\n• 만료 명령 거부 OK", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 700072, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700073, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "p4", "lineHeight": 1.4},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "p5", "x": 1580, "y": 130, "width": 250, "height": 1230, "strokeColor": "#b45309", "backgroundColor": "#fef3c7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 700080, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700081, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "p5t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "p5t", "x": 1590, "y": 145, "width": 230, "height": 1200, "text": "Phase 5\nGateway Config\nVersioning + OTA\n\n기간: TBD\n\nDeliverables:\n• gateway_configs\n• desired/reported\n• config_version + hash\n• rollback\n• Mender community\n• A/B partition\n• 서명 검증\n• 점진 배포 정책\n\n진입조건:\n• Phase 4 통과\n• 첫 paying customer\n  확보 (LOI)\n탈출조건:\n• 5대 동시 OTA OK\n• rollback 검증\n• Mender 라이선스 OK", "originalText": "Phase 5\nGateway Config\nVersioning + OTA\n\n기간: TBD\n\nDeliverables:\n• gateway_configs\n• desired/reported\n• config_version + hash\n• rollback\n• Mender community\n• A/B partition\n• 서명 검증\n• 점진 배포 정책\n\n진입조건:\n• Phase 4 통과\n• 첫 paying customer\n  확보 (LOI)\n탈출조건:\n• 5대 동시 OTA OK\n• rollback 검증\n• Mender 라이선스 OK", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 700082, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700083, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "p5", "lineHeight": 1.4},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "p6", "x": 1880, "y": 130, "width": 250, "height": 1230, "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "#a7f3d0", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 700090, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700091, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "p6t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "p6t", "x": 1890, "y": 145, "width": 230, "height": 1200, "text": "Phase 6\n관리 편의성\n+ RLS\n\n기간: TBD\n\nDeliverables:\n• Gateway Template\n• Bulk Operation 8종\n• Gateway Group\n• Sensor Profile\n  Library\n• Alarm Rule UI\n• PostgreSQL RLS\n• 운영자 매뉴얼\n\n진입조건:\n• Phase 5 통과\n• 10대+ 운영 실측\n탈출조건:\n• Bulk OTA 50대\n  3분 내 완료\n• RLS 적용 → 권한\n  외 row 차단 OK", "originalText": "Phase 6\n관리 편의성\n+ RLS\n\n기간: TBD\n\nDeliverables:\n• Gateway Template\n• Bulk Operation 8종\n• Gateway Group\n• Sensor Profile\n  Library\n• Alarm Rule UI\n• PostgreSQL RLS\n• 운영자 매뉴얼\n\n진입조건:\n• Phase 5 통과\n• 10대+ 운영 실측\n탈출조건:\n• Bulk OTA 50대\n  3분 내 완료\n• RLS 적용 → 권한\n  외 row 차단 OK", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 700092, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700093, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "p6", "lineHeight": 1.4},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "p7", "x": 2180, "y": 130, "width": 250, "height": 1230, "strokeColor": "#dc2626", "backgroundColor": "#fee2e2", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 700100, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700101, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "p7t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "p7t", "x": 2190, "y": 145, "width": 230, "height": 1200, "text": "Phase 7\n제품화\n\n기간: TBD\n\nDeliverables:\n• Gateway X.509 cert\n• VerneMQ TLS 8883\n• VerneMQ ACL\n• Backup automation\n• Safety MCU 외부\n  STM32 supervisor\n• 자체 PCB 양산 image\n• OSS Notice + SBOM\n• KC/EMC 인증\n• 현장 시험 + 매뉴얼\n\n진입조건:\n• Phase 6 통과\n• 50대+ 운영 실증\n탈출조건:\n• 양산 200대\n• KC 인증 통과\n• 첫 제조 lot 출하", "originalText": "Phase 7\n제품화\n\n기간: TBD\n\nDeliverables:\n• Gateway X.509 cert\n• VerneMQ TLS 8883\n• VerneMQ ACL\n• Backup automation\n• Safety MCU 외부\n  STM32 supervisor\n• 자체 PCB 양산 image\n• OSS Notice + SBOM\n• KC/EMC 인증\n• 현장 시험 + 매뉴얼\n\n진입조건:\n• Phase 6 통과\n• 50대+ 운영 실증\n탈출조건:\n• 양산 200대\n• KC 인증 통과\n• 첫 제조 lot 출하", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 700102, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700103, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "p7", "lineHeight": 1.4},

